    {
      "id": "claim_b07e87922eb04974957a95e31e3a2180",
      "statement": "computeVisibleContextId hashes the visible form-control signature into a ctx_ id; if an action request's visibleContextId differs from the current page's id, handleContentRequest returns a stale_context error with reason visible_controls_changed, and form actions annotate results with contextStale when computeVisibleFormStructureId shifts after acting.",
