    {
      "id": "claim_b6d7f8685b414a8dac2557d7399cc157",
      "statement": "Action targets carry optional validation fields (expectedText, expectedHref for links, expectedRole for actions, expectedLabel for form controls); performClick resolves the positional element then runs validateClickTarget checking case-insensitive substring text, pathname-only href, and role, returning a stale_context error with expected-vs-found detail on mismatch; omitting the fields preserves legacy find-by-position behavior.",
